%% alt: The enterprise RAG assistant, top to bottom. Untrusted sources (the wiki, drives, policies and tickets) send change events, repaired by a nightly job, to indexing workers that parse, chunk and embed into vector and keyword indexes, each chunk carrying its allowed groups. The assistant API takes an employee's question, gets the asker's groups from the identity provider, runs a filtered hybrid search with reranking, and calls the model through the AI gateway. The model answers only from the passages and has no tools; a cited answer streams back to the employee.
%% caption: Permissions travel with every chunk and are checked inside the search; change events keep the index fresh. The documents are untrusted, so the model gets no way to send data out.
flowchart TB
  classDef control fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#1f1147
  classDef data fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#3b2405
  classDef model fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#4338ca,color:#14123d
  classDef human fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#4b5563,color:#111827
  classDef untrusted fill:#fff1f2,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#3f0a0a

  src["Wiki · drives · policies · tickets"]:::untrusted
  ev[["Change events + nightly repair job"]]
  iw["Indexing workers: parse · chunk · embed"]
  idx[("Vector + keyword indexes<br/>each chunk with its allowed groups")]:::data
  idp[("Identity provider<br/>user → groups")]:::data
  api["Assistant API<br/>takes the employee's question"]
  gw{{"AI gateway: quotas · fallback"}}:::control
  llm(["LLM: answers only from<br/>the passages, no tools"]):::model
  user(["Employee: a cited answer, streamed"]):::human

  src --> ev --> iw --> idx
  idx -- "filtered hybrid<br/>search, rerank" --> api
  idp -- "groups" --> api
  api --> gw --> llm --> user
